{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台灣今日舉行九合一選舉。</p><p></p><p>其中焦點之一是台北市長選舉。競逐連任、國民黨的蔣萬安，民進黨的沈伯洋，上午分別到票站投票。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TW.ELECTION-1230_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YLANNJqMSz1795842980.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>四年一度的九合一選舉，投票由上午八時開始，下午四時結束。將會選出縣市長、縣市議員等九項地方公職人員約1.1萬人，以及一項「廢除非核家園」公投。選民人數有約1,957萬。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T05:23:50.521859+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T04:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T05:17:14.368571+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:17:14.368571+00:00","content_hash":"7953bbc6fd25368db03044e2128c1f81f48e675097fd4cec56e981a12128ef90","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}